==========================================================================
  RQ3: the pre-sampling prediction
==========================================================================
  Recorded before sampling (FINDINGS_gpp.md):
    CONFIRMED by both gross fluxes biased high by the same absolute
      amount, leaving NEE right for the wrong reasons.
    FALSIFIED by GPP near 1,030 and Reco near 850.

  GPP  excess over measured midpoint     +625.2 g C m-2 yr-1
  Reco excess over measured midpoint     +680.8
  NEE  error against observed             +72.5

  -> NEITHER cleanly. The numbers above do not match either arm of
     the prediction as stated; describe what they do show rather
     than forcing them into one.

  The seasonal half of the prediction -- a systematic autumn deficit and
  spring surplus in the monthly residuals -- is NOT tested here. It needs
  monthly posterior-predictive residuals from the saved trace, which is
  a separate pass. Do not report this verdict as covering it.

